From 795035f243d0506b36c24a1c2f41136ed9ef68c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Icesito <113939920+Icesito68@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:13:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] r9q: desactivar CRYPTO_FIPS
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

El test de integridad FIPS (HMAC del código criptográfico calculado al
enlazar) no cuadra con el toolchain de Android 16 y el kernel hace panic
a los 0,77 s: "FIPS : POST - integrity test failed".
Change-Id: Ibb3c38fb304529f1ddd5dd39249007ef7461e065
---
 arch/arm64/configs/vendor/r9q_eur_openx2_defconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/r9q_eur_openx2_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/r9q_eur_openx2_defconfig
index 7e105cbe3..f29fc3824 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/r9q_eur_openx2_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/r9q_eur_openx2_defconfig
@@ -6825,7 +6825,7 @@ CONFIG_CRYPTO=y
 #
 # Crypto core or helper
 #
-CONFIG_CRYPTO_FIPS=y
+# CONFIG_CRYPTO_FIPS is not set
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_ALGAPI=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_ALGAPI2=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_AEAD=y
